WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:03,370
In the peaceful past, how could we live together and die together?

2
00:00:03,370 --> 00:00:08,590
Or do wealthy families really have the means to assassinate and kill each other?

3
00:00:08,590 --> 00:00:13,870
Are you wondering whether you should expose your spatial skills?

4
00:00:13,870 --> 00:00:17,790
Why are you acting like a poisonous person?

5
00:00:17,790 --> 00:00:19,790
Does this require the use of Poison Heart Book?

6
00:00:19,790 --> 00:00:25,340
Make a bet, even if you use the space in front of them, they won't bother you

7
00:00:25,340 --> 00:00:26,460
Believe it or not?

8
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:31,170
How is it possible, given the acting skills of Sister Wang and Fan Jiawen?

9
00:00:31,170 --> 00:00:33,170
I'm not ready yet, so I'll tell you later

10
00:00:33,170 --> 00:00:36,230
Aren't Liu Yang and the others not ready to confess yet?

11
00:00:36,230 --> 00:00:41,430
You are indeed suitable to be the boss

12
00:00:41,430 --> 00:00:47,850
Can I take it as you are complimenting me?

13
00:00:47,850 --> 00:00:50,980
Let’s also collect half of these seasoning tickets.

14
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:56,220
I'm complimenting you, one third is enough

15
00:00:56,220 --> 00:00:59,220
There are two thirds left, let’s exchange for other supplies.

16
00:00:59,220 --> 00:01:02,280
Ten tons of salt, enough for us to use for a long time

17
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:05,410
Other survivors are also needed, there is no need to all stand.

18
00:01:05,410 --> 00:01:07,950
Okay, listen to you

19
00:01:07,950 --> 00:01:15,380
twenty barrels

20
00:01:16,380 --> 00:01:19,900
Just save all the oil. Liu Yang’s fried potatoes are delicious.

21
00:01:19,900 --> 00:01:28,295
Not only work overtime

22
00:01:28,295 --> 00:01:36,690
Gotta work harder
